<Mod id="9b08d66b-9159-4212-bb2a-ab9d2d56350c" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>Global - Faith Purchases in Puppets</Name>
    <Teaser>
	[ICON_BULLET]Allows faith purchases in puppets.
	[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Requires the [COLOR_POSITIVE_TEXT]09/02/20[ENDCOLOR] version or newer of Vox Populi.</Teaser>
    <Description>Allows faith purchases of all buildings, Missionaries, and Inquisitors in puppeted cities, including faith purchases unlocked from Reformation beliefs.</Description>
    <Authors>HungryForFood</Authors>
